---
to: 'support@desksnear.me'
from: 'Desks Near Me <no-reply@desksnear.me>'
reply_to: '{{ data.reporter_email }}'
subject: 'Message report — conversation {{ data.conversation_id }}'
layout: mailer
delay: 0
enabled: true
trigger_condition: true
---
<h2>A conversation has been reported</h2>
<p><strong>Reported by:</strong> {{ data.reporter_name }} ({{ data.reporter_email }})</p>
<p><strong>Conversation:</strong> {{ data.conversation_id }}</p>
<p><strong>Space:</strong> {{ data.listing_title }}</p>
<p><strong>Other party:</strong> {{ data.other_name }}</p>
<p><strong>Reason given:</strong></p>
<blockquote style="margin:1em 0;padding:.75em 1em;border-left:3px solid #c0392b;background:#faf6f5;">
  {{ data.reason | newline_to_br }}
</blockquote>
<p style="color:#777;font-size:13px;">Review the thread in the admin database viewer under <code>conversation</code> / <code>message</code>.</p>